{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47414","headline":"句 · 杜光庭","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜壶滴滴禁漏起，三十六宫争卷帘。\n斜阳古岸归鸦晚，红蓼低沙宿雁愁。\n霜雕曲径寒芜白，雁下遥村落照黄。\n恩威欲寄黄丞相，仁信先闻郭细侯。\n兵气此时来世上，文星今日到人间。\n降因天下思姚宋，出爲儒门继孔颜。\n丹竈河车休矻矻，蚌胎龟息且緜緜。\n驭景必能趋日域，骑箕终拟蹑星躔。\n返朴还淳皆至理，遗形忘性尽真铨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}